1
00:00:02,438 --> 00:00:03,647
Water...

2
00:00:04,816 --> 00:00:05,983
Earth...

3
00:00:06,693 --> 00:00:07,901
Fire...

4
00:00:08,987 --> 00:00:10,070
Air.

5
00:00:11,197 --> 00:00:14,449
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

6
00:00:15,368 --> 00:00:18,662
Then everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

7
00:00:19,664 --> 00:00:20,789
Only the Avatar,

8
00:00:20,873 --> 00:00:22,332
master of all four elements,

9
00:00:22,417 --> 00:00:23,583
could stop them.

10
00:00:23,668 --> 00:00:25,419
But when the world needed him most,

11
00:00:25,503 --> 00:00:26,753
he vanished.

12
00:00:27,213 --> 00:00:28,380
A hundred years passed,

13
00:00:28,464 --> 00:00:30,882
and my brother and I
discovered the new Avatar,

14
00:00:30,967 --> 00:00:32,968
an airbender named Aang,

15
00:00:33,052 --> 00:00:35,095
and although
his airbending skills are great,

16
00:00:35,179 --> 00:00:38,348
he has a lot to learn
before he's ready to save anyone.

17
00:00:38,891 --> 00:00:41,935
But I believe Aang can save the world.

18
00:01:03,875 --> 00:01:05,459
Wait till you see it, Katara.

19
00:01:05,543 --> 00:01:07,210
The air temple
is one of the most beautiful places

20
00:01:07,295 --> 00:01:08,420
in the world.

21
00:01:08,629 --> 00:01:10,297
Aang, I know you're excited,

22
00:01:10,381 --> 00:01:11,590
but it's been a hundred years

23
00:01:11,674 --> 00:01:13,008
since you've been home.

24
00:01:13,092 --> 00:01:14,551
That's why I'm so excited!

25
00:01:14,886 --> 00:01:17,471
It's just that a lot can change
in all that time.

26
00:01:17,555 --> 00:01:18,555
I know,

27
00:01:18,639 --> 00:01:20,057
but I need to see it for myself.

28
00:01:24,437 --> 00:01:25,896
Wake up, Sokka.

29
00:01:25,980 --> 00:01:27,689
Air temple, here we come!

30
00:01:29,359 --> 00:01:31,151
Sleep now. Temple later.

31
00:01:38,326 --> 00:01:39,659
Sokka, wake up!

32
00:01:39,744 --> 00:01:41,661
There's a prickle snake
in your sleeping bag!

33
00:01:42,455 --> 00:01:43,497
Aah!

34
00:01:43,581 --> 00:01:44,915
Get it off! Get it off!

35
00:01:44,999 --> 00:01:45,999
Aah!

36
00:01:46,125 --> 00:01:47,292
Heh heh heh!

37
00:01:47,377 --> 00:01:48,627
Great. You're awake.

38
00:01:48,711 --> 00:01:49,711
Let's go.

39
00:01:54,842 --> 00:01:56,176
Uncle, I want the repairs made

40
00:01:56,260 --> 00:01:57,302
as quickly as possible.

41
00:01:57,387 --> 00:01:58,720
I don't want to stay too long

42
00:01:58,805 --> 00:02:00,013
and risk losing his trail.

43
00:02:00,098 --> 00:02:01,306
You mean the Avatar?

44
00:02:01,391 --> 00:02:02,682
Don't mention his name on these docks.

45
00:02:03,017 --> 00:02:04,601
Once word gets out that he's alive,

46
00:02:04,685 --> 00:02:06,728
every firebender
will be out looking for him,

47
00:02:06,813 --> 00:02:08,647
and I don't want anyone
getting in the way.

48
00:02:08,731 --> 00:02:10,690
Getting in the way of what,

49
00:02:10,775 --> 00:02:11,942
Prince Zuko.

50
00:02:12,026 --> 00:02:13,485
Captain Zhao.

51
00:02:13,569 --> 00:02:14,903
It's commander now.

52
00:02:14,987 --> 00:02:16,363
And General Iroh,

53
00:02:16,447 --> 00:02:18,490
great hero of our nation.

54
00:02:18,574 --> 00:02:20,242
Retired general.

55
00:02:20,326 --> 00:02:21,952
The Fire Lord's brother and son

56
00:02:22,036 --> 00:02:23,912
are welcome guests anytime.

57
00:02:24,247 --> 00:02:25,705
What brings you to my harbor?

58
00:02:25,790 --> 00:02:27,582
Our ship is being repaired.

59
00:02:29,460 --> 00:02:31,169
That's quite a bit of damage.

60
00:02:31,546 --> 00:02:34,047
Yes. You wouldn't believe
what happened.

61
00:02:34,757 --> 00:02:36,842
Uncle, tell Commander Zhao
what happened.

62
00:02:36,926 --> 00:02:38,593
Yes, I will do that.

63
00:02:38,886 --> 00:02:40,929
It was incredible.

64
00:02:41,347 --> 00:02:42,931
What, did we crash or something?

65
00:02:43,015 --> 00:02:46,518
Yes! Right into an Earth Kingdom ship.

66
00:02:47,019 --> 00:02:48,019
Really?

67
00:02:48,104 --> 00:02:51,231
You must regale me
with all the thrilling details.

68
00:02:51,649 --> 00:02:53,608
Join me for a drink?

69
00:02:53,943 --> 00:02:55,318
Sorry, but we have to go.

70
00:02:55,403 --> 00:02:56,778
Prince Zuko,

71
00:02:56,863 --> 00:02:59,197
show Commander Zhao your respect.

72
00:02:59,615 --> 00:03:01,950
We would be honored to join you.

73
00:03:02,034 --> 00:03:05,537
Do you have any ginseng tea?
It's my favorite.

74
00:03:14,464 --> 00:03:16,047
Hey, stomach, be quiet, all right?

75
00:03:16,132 --> 00:03:17,883
I'm trying to find us some food.

76
00:03:24,724 --> 00:03:27,350
Hey! Who ate all
my blubbered seal jerky?

77
00:03:27,435 --> 00:03:29,519
That was food?

78
00:03:29,604 --> 00:03:31,688
I used it to start
the campfire last night.

79
00:03:31,772 --> 00:03:32,898
Sorry.

80
00:03:32,982 --> 00:03:34,524
You what?

81
00:03:34,609 --> 00:03:35,817
Aww.

82
00:03:35,902 --> 00:03:37,944
No wonder the flames smelled so good.

83
00:03:40,656 --> 00:03:41,781
The Potola mountain range!

84
00:03:41,866 --> 00:03:43,366
We're almost there!

85
00:03:43,451 --> 00:03:45,368
Aang, before we get to the temple,

86
00:03:45,453 --> 00:03:47,579
I want to talk to you
about the airbenders.

87
00:03:47,663 --> 00:03:48,788
What about them?

88
00:03:48,873 --> 00:03:49,956
Well...

89
00:03:50,041 --> 00:03:51,416
I just want you to be prepared

90
00:03:51,501 --> 00:03:52,959
for what you might see.

91
00:03:53,294 --> 00:03:55,295
The Fire Nation is ruthless.

92
00:03:55,379 --> 00:03:57,380
They killed my mother,

93
00:03:57,465 --> 00:03:58,590
and they could have done the same

94
00:03:58,674 --> 00:04:00,091
to your people.

95
00:04:00,426 --> 00:04:02,344
Just because no one
has seen an airbender

96
00:04:02,428 --> 00:04:04,137
doesn't mean the Fire Nation
killed them all.

97
00:04:04,222 --> 00:04:05,555
They probably escaped.

98
00:04:05,640 --> 00:04:07,432
I know it's hard to accept.

99
00:04:07,517 --> 00:04:09,142
You don't understand, Katara.

100
00:04:09,227 --> 00:04:10,602
The only way to get to
an airbender temple

101
00:04:10,686 --> 00:04:12,187
is on a flying bison,

102
00:04:12,271 --> 00:04:14,356
and I doubt the Fire Nation
has any flying bison.

103
00:04:14,440 --> 00:04:15,565
Right, Appa?

104
00:04:16,901 --> 00:04:18,068
Yip yip!

105
00:04:33,209 --> 00:04:36,878
There it is,
the Southern Air Temple.

106
00:04:37,713 --> 00:04:39,339
Aang, it's amazing!

107
00:04:40,216 --> 00:04:42,384
We're home, buddy. We're home.

108
00:04:47,473 --> 00:04:48,640
And by year's end,

109
00:04:48,724 --> 00:04:50,850
the Earth Kingdom capital
will be under our rule.

110
00:04:51,686 --> 00:04:53,979
The Fire Lord will finally claim

111
00:04:54,063 --> 00:04:55,272
victory in this war.

112
00:04:55,356 --> 00:04:57,023
If my father thinks
the rest of the world

113
00:04:57,108 --> 00:04:58,275
will follow him willingly,

114
00:04:58,359 --> 00:04:59,568
then he is a fool.

115
00:05:00,027 --> 00:05:01,027
Two years at sea

116
00:05:01,112 --> 00:05:02,779
have done little
to temper your tongue.

117
00:05:03,739 --> 00:05:07,242
So, how's your search
for the Avatar going?

118
00:05:09,704 --> 00:05:12,205
My fault entirely.

119
00:05:12,999 --> 00:05:14,624
We haven't found him yet.

120
00:05:14,709 --> 00:05:16,543
Did you really expect to?

121
00:05:16,627 --> 00:05:18,878
The Avatar died a hundred years ago

122
00:05:18,963 --> 00:05:21,506
along with the rest of the airbenders.

123
00:05:22,633 --> 00:05:24,843
Unless you found some evidence

124
00:05:24,927 --> 00:05:26,553
that the Avatar is alive.

125
00:05:26,637 --> 00:05:28,638
No. Nothing.

126
00:05:29,056 --> 00:05:31,641
Prince Zuko,
the Avatar is the only one

127
00:05:31,726 --> 00:05:32,892
who can stop the Fire Nation

128
00:05:32,977 --> 00:05:34,477
from winning this war.

129
00:05:34,562 --> 00:05:36,605
If you have an ounce of loyalty left,

130
00:05:36,689 --> 00:05:38,648
you'll tell me what you found.

131
00:05:38,733 --> 00:05:41,109
I haven't found anything.

132
00:05:41,861 --> 00:05:43,028
It's like you said--

133
00:05:43,112 --> 00:05:46,281
The Avatar probably died
a long time ago.

134
00:05:46,866 --> 00:05:48,742
Come on, uncle. We're going.

135
00:05:49,327 --> 00:05:50,952
Commander Zhao,

136
00:05:51,037 --> 00:05:53,038
we interrogated the crew
as you instructed.

137
00:05:53,122 --> 00:05:54,497
They confirmed Prince Zuko

138
00:05:54,582 --> 00:05:56,374
had the Avatar in custody

139
00:05:56,459 --> 00:05:58,001
but let him escape.

140
00:05:58,794 --> 00:06:00,712
Now remind me,

141
00:06:00,796 --> 00:06:05,008
how exactly was your ship damaged?

142
00:06:12,933 --> 00:06:14,517
So where do I get something to eat?

143
00:06:14,977 --> 00:06:17,812
You're lucky enough
to be one of the first outsiders

144
00:06:17,897 --> 00:06:19,981
to ever visit an airbender temple,

145
00:06:20,066 --> 00:06:22,025
and all you can think about is food?

146
00:06:22,318 --> 00:06:24,861
I'm just a simple guy
with simple needs.

147
00:06:26,072 --> 00:06:27,238
So that's where my friends and I

148
00:06:27,323 --> 00:06:28,448
would play airball,

149
00:06:28,532 --> 00:06:30,617
and over there is where
the bison would sleep.

150
00:06:30,701 --> 00:06:31,701
And...

151
00:06:32,995 --> 00:06:34,245
What's wrong?

152
00:06:34,330 --> 00:06:37,165
This place used to be full of monks
and lemurs and bison.

153
00:06:37,500 --> 00:06:39,042
Now there's just a bunch of weeds.

154
00:06:41,629 --> 00:06:44,422
I can't believe how much
things have changed.

155
00:06:45,383 --> 00:06:46,383
So,

156
00:06:46,467 --> 00:06:48,134
this airball game-- How do you play?

157
00:07:02,274 --> 00:07:03,358
Ooh!

158
00:07:04,485 --> 00:07:05,777
Ha ha ha!

159
00:07:06,445 --> 00:07:08,780
Aang seven, Sokka zero.

160
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:10,615
Making him feel better

161
00:07:10,700 --> 00:07:12,158
is putting me in a world of hurt.

162
00:07:17,248 --> 00:07:19,290
Katara, check this out.

163
00:07:20,543 --> 00:07:21,626
Fire Nation.

164
00:07:21,711 --> 00:07:22,961
We should tell him.

165
00:07:23,546 --> 00:07:25,714
Aang, there's something
you need to see.

166
00:07:26,340 --> 00:07:27,424
Ok.

167
00:07:33,681 --> 00:07:34,806
What is it?

168
00:07:34,890 --> 00:07:38,101
Just a new
waterbending move I learned.

169
00:07:38,185 --> 00:07:40,061
Nice one. But enough practicing.

170
00:07:40,521 --> 00:07:42,397
We have a whole temple to see.

171
00:07:44,024 --> 00:07:46,025
You know,
you can't protect him forever.

172
00:07:53,075 --> 00:07:54,826
Katara, firebenders were here.

173
00:07:54,910 --> 00:07:56,286
You can't pretend they weren't.

174
00:07:56,620 --> 00:07:58,371
I can for Aang's sake.

175
00:07:58,456 --> 00:08:01,332
If he finds out that the Fire Nation
invaded his home,

176
00:08:01,417 --> 00:08:02,625
he'll be devastated.

177
00:08:02,710 --> 00:08:03,960
Hey, guys!

178
00:08:04,378 --> 00:08:05,670
I want you to meet somebody.

179
00:08:05,755 --> 00:08:06,796
Who's that?

180
00:08:06,881 --> 00:08:08,298
Monk Gyatso,

181
00:08:08,382 --> 00:08:09,924
the greatest airbender in the world.

182
00:08:10,718 --> 00:08:12,761
He taught me everything I know.

183
00:08:16,015 --> 00:08:20,018
But the true secret
is in the gooey center.

184
00:08:21,687 --> 00:08:23,813
My ancient cake making technique

185
00:08:23,898 --> 00:08:25,940
isn't the only thing on your mind,

186
00:08:26,025 --> 00:08:27,692
is it, Aang?

187
00:08:27,777 --> 00:08:29,611
This whole Avatar thing--

188
00:08:29,695 --> 00:08:31,905
Maybe the monks made a mistake.

189
00:08:32,239 --> 00:08:33,865
The only mistake they made

190
00:08:33,949 --> 00:08:36,659
was telling you before you turned 16.

191
00:08:36,744 --> 00:08:39,537
But we can't concern ourselves
with what was.

192
00:08:39,622 --> 00:08:42,040
We must act on what is.

193
00:08:46,629 --> 00:08:47,921
But, Gyatso,

194
00:08:48,005 --> 00:08:49,839
how do I know if I'm ready for this?

195
00:08:50,299 --> 00:08:52,258
Your questions will be answered

196
00:08:52,343 --> 00:08:56,387
when you're old enough
to enter the air temple sanctuary.

197
00:08:56,722 --> 00:08:58,973
Inside, you will meet someone

198
00:08:59,058 --> 00:09:01,309
who will guide you on your journey.

199
00:09:01,393 --> 00:09:02,560
Who is it?

200
00:09:02,645 --> 00:09:04,187
When you are ready,

201
00:09:04,271 --> 00:09:06,356
he will reveal himself to you.

202
00:09:07,525 --> 00:09:08,691
Now...

203
00:09:09,318 --> 00:09:12,153
Are you going to help me
with these cakes

204
00:09:12,238 --> 00:09:13,363
or not?

205
00:09:13,447 --> 00:09:14,739
All right.

206
00:09:16,200 --> 00:09:18,535
One... Two...

207
00:09:18,619 --> 00:09:19,619
Three.

208
00:09:29,547 --> 00:09:31,506
Your aim has improved greatly,

209
00:09:31,590 --> 00:09:33,550
my young pupil.

210
00:09:37,805 --> 00:09:39,430
You must miss him.

211
00:09:39,515 --> 00:09:40,723
Yeah.

212
00:09:40,808 --> 00:09:42,141
Where are you going?

213
00:09:42,226 --> 00:09:43,768
The air temple sanctuary.

214
00:09:43,853 --> 00:09:45,353
There's someone I'm ready to meet.

215
00:09:53,279 --> 00:09:54,487
But, Aang,

216
00:09:54,572 --> 00:09:55,905
no one could have survived in there

217
00:09:55,990 --> 00:09:57,615
for a hundred years.

218
00:09:57,700 --> 00:09:59,242
It's not impossible.

219
00:09:59,326 --> 00:10:01,286
I survived in the iceberg
for that long.

220
00:10:01,370 --> 00:10:02,370
Good point.

221
00:10:02,663 --> 00:10:04,414
Katara, whoever's in there

222
00:10:04,498 --> 00:10:06,291
might help me figure out
this Avatar thing.

223
00:10:06,375 --> 00:10:08,459
And whoever's in there
might have a medley

224
00:10:08,544 --> 00:10:11,421
of delicious cured meats.

225
00:10:12,381 --> 00:10:13,590
Ooh!

226
00:10:13,674 --> 00:10:14,674
Unh!

227
00:10:16,051 --> 00:10:17,886
I don't suppose you have a key.

228
00:10:17,970 --> 00:10:20,763
The key, Sokka, is airbending.

229
00:10:49,627 --> 00:10:51,002
Hello?

230
00:10:51,420 --> 00:10:52,837
Anyone home?

231
00:11:05,225 --> 00:11:06,601
So a 12-year-old boy

232
00:11:06,685 --> 00:11:08,853
bested you and your firebenders.

233
00:11:09,563 --> 00:11:11,397
You're more pathetic than I thought.

234
00:11:11,482 --> 00:11:12,899
I underestimated him once,

235
00:11:12,983 --> 00:11:14,317
but it will not happen again.

236
00:11:14,401 --> 00:11:15,777
No, it will not,

237
00:11:15,861 --> 00:11:17,612
because you won't
have a second chance.

238
00:11:17,696 --> 00:11:18,696
Commander Zhao,

239
00:11:18,781 --> 00:11:20,740
I've been hunting the Avatar
for two years, and I--

240
00:11:20,824 --> 00:11:21,950
And you failed.

241
00:11:22,034 --> 00:11:23,576
Capturing the Avatar is too important

242
00:11:23,661 --> 00:11:25,536
to leave in a teenager's hands.

243
00:11:25,621 --> 00:11:26,996
He's mine now.

244
00:11:28,624 --> 00:11:29,791
Keep them here.

245
00:11:33,629 --> 00:11:35,505
More tea, please.

246
00:11:50,980 --> 00:11:52,563
Statues?

247
00:11:52,648 --> 00:11:53,982
That's it?

248
00:11:54,066 --> 00:11:55,566
Where's the meat?

249
00:11:55,901 --> 00:11:57,235
Who are all these people?

250
00:11:57,319 --> 00:11:59,278
I'm not sure.

251
00:11:59,363 --> 00:12:01,239
But it feels like I know them somehow.

252
00:12:01,323 --> 00:12:02,323
Look!

253
00:12:02,408 --> 00:12:03,533
That one's an airbender!

254
00:12:03,617 --> 00:12:05,034
And this one's a waterbender.

255
00:12:05,369 --> 00:12:06,619
They're lined up in a pattern.

256
00:12:07,246 --> 00:12:10,373
Air, water, earth, and fire.

257
00:12:10,457 --> 00:12:12,083
That's the Avatar cycle.

258
00:12:12,167 --> 00:12:14,752
Of course. They're Avatars.

259
00:12:15,212 --> 00:12:17,588
All these people
are your past lives, Aang.

260
00:12:17,673 --> 00:12:20,383
Wow! There's so many.

261
00:12:23,137 --> 00:12:24,429
Past lives?

262
00:12:24,513 --> 00:12:26,681
Katara, you really
believe in that stuff?

263
00:12:26,765 --> 00:12:27,974
It's true.

264
00:12:28,058 --> 00:12:30,018
When the Avatar dies,

265
00:12:30,102 --> 00:12:32,020
he's reincarnated
into the next nation in the cycle.

266
00:12:38,652 --> 00:12:40,319
Aang, snap out of it.

267
00:12:42,781 --> 00:12:44,073
Who is that?

268
00:12:44,158 --> 00:12:46,659
That's Avatar Roku,
the Avatar before me.

269
00:12:47,369 --> 00:12:48,953
You were a firebender?

270
00:12:49,038 --> 00:12:51,080
No wonder I didn't trust you
when we first met.

271
00:12:51,290 --> 00:12:52,582
There's no writing.

272
00:12:52,666 --> 00:12:53,666
How do you know his name?

273
00:12:53,751 --> 00:12:55,001
I'm not sure.

274
00:12:55,419 --> 00:12:57,378
I just know it somehow.

275
00:12:58,672 --> 00:13:00,298
You just couldn't get any weirder.

276
00:13:00,591 --> 00:13:02,341
♪♪♪♪

277
00:13:10,059 --> 00:13:12,268
Firebender.
Nobody make a sound.

278
00:13:12,394 --> 00:13:13,478
You're making a sound.

279
00:13:13,562 --> 00:13:14,604
Shh! Shh!

280
00:13:22,029 --> 00:13:23,905
That firebender
won't know what hit him.

281
00:13:34,583 --> 00:13:35,583
Lemur!

282
00:13:35,667 --> 00:13:36,793
Dinner.

283
00:13:36,877 --> 00:13:38,211
Don't listen to him.

284
00:13:38,295 --> 00:13:39,587
You're gonna be my new pet.

285
00:13:39,671 --> 00:13:40,880
Not if I get him first!

286
00:13:45,135 --> 00:13:46,302
Wait! Come back!

287
00:13:46,386 --> 00:13:48,221
I want to eat you!

288
00:13:55,020 --> 00:13:56,312
Ha ha ha!

289
00:13:58,649 --> 00:13:59,982
Aah! Unh!

290
00:14:11,411 --> 00:14:12,662
Hey! No fair!

291
00:14:18,085 --> 00:14:19,210
My search party is ready.

292
00:14:19,294 --> 00:14:21,003
Once I'm out to sea,

293
00:14:21,088 --> 00:14:22,797
my guards will escort you
back to your ship,

294
00:14:22,881 --> 00:14:24,423
And you will be free to go.

295
00:14:24,508 --> 00:14:26,050
Why? Are you worried

296
00:14:26,135 --> 00:14:28,010
I'm going to try and stop you?

297
00:14:28,345 --> 00:14:30,346
Ha ha ha!

298
00:14:30,430 --> 00:14:32,473
You... Stop me?

299
00:14:32,558 --> 00:14:33,766
Impossible.

300
00:14:34,059 --> 00:14:35,810
Don't underestimate me, Zhao.

301
00:14:35,894 --> 00:14:37,728
I will capture the Avatar before you.

302
00:14:38,063 --> 00:14:39,897
Prince Zuko, that's enough.

303
00:14:39,982 --> 00:14:42,233
You can't compete with me.

304
00:14:42,317 --> 00:14:44,777
I have hundreds of warships
under my command,

305
00:14:44,862 --> 00:14:45,987
And you,

306
00:14:46,071 --> 00:14:47,822
you're just a banished prince.

307
00:14:47,906 --> 00:14:50,616
No home, no allies.

308
00:14:50,701 --> 00:14:52,910
Your own father doesn't even want you.

309
00:14:53,245 --> 00:14:54,495
You're wrong.

310
00:14:54,580 --> 00:14:56,372
Once I deliver
the Avatar to my father,

311
00:14:56,456 --> 00:14:58,457
he will welcome me home with honor

312
00:14:58,542 --> 00:15:00,751
and restore my rightful place
on the throne.

313
00:15:01,086 --> 00:15:03,796
If your father really wanted you home,

314
00:15:03,881 --> 00:15:05,464
he would have let you return by now,

315
00:15:05,549 --> 00:15:07,758
Avatar or no Avatar.

316
00:15:07,843 --> 00:15:09,844
But in his eyes, you are a failure

317
00:15:09,928 --> 00:15:11,846
and a disgrace to the Fire Nation.

318
00:15:11,930 --> 00:15:13,181
That's not true.

319
00:15:13,682 --> 00:15:15,391
You have the scar to prove it.

320
00:15:15,475 --> 00:15:17,602
Aah! Maybe you'd like one to match!

321
00:15:17,686 --> 00:15:19,312
Is that a challenge?

322
00:15:19,396 --> 00:15:22,231
An Agni Kai at sunset.

323
00:15:22,983 --> 00:15:24,066
Very well.

324
00:15:24,693 --> 00:15:26,611
It's a shame your father won't be here

325
00:15:26,695 --> 00:15:28,738
to watch me humiliate you.

326
00:15:28,822 --> 00:15:30,531
I guess your uncle will do.

327
00:15:31,074 --> 00:15:32,575
Prince Zuko,

328
00:15:32,659 --> 00:15:34,076
have you forgotten what happened

329
00:15:34,161 --> 00:15:35,995
the last time you dueled a master?

330
00:15:36,538 --> 00:15:38,080
I will never forget.

331
00:15:44,963 --> 00:15:46,422
Hey! Come back!

332
00:15:47,007 --> 00:15:48,466
Come on out, little lemur.

333
00:15:48,550 --> 00:15:50,593
That hungry guy
won't bother you anymore.

334
00:15:54,723 --> 00:15:56,307
Firebenders?

335
00:15:56,391 --> 00:15:58,267
They were here?

336
00:16:05,317 --> 00:16:06,817
Gyatso.

337
00:16:08,362 --> 00:16:09,946
Hey, Aang, you find my dinner yet?

338
00:16:11,156 --> 00:16:14,200
Aang, I wasn't really gonna
eat the lemur, ok?

339
00:16:14,868 --> 00:16:16,077
Man.

340
00:16:17,037 --> 00:16:18,120
Come on, Aang.

341
00:16:18,205 --> 00:16:19,455
Everything will be all right.

342
00:16:19,539 --> 00:16:20,665
Let's get out of here.

343
00:16:37,266 --> 00:16:38,266
Aang!

344
00:16:49,653 --> 00:16:52,571
Send word
to the Fire Lord immediately.

345
00:16:52,656 --> 00:16:54,865
The Avatar has returned.

346
00:17:01,832 --> 00:17:03,457
Aang, come on!

347
00:17:03,542 --> 00:17:05,418
Snap out of it! Aah!

348
00:17:08,046 --> 00:17:09,255
Aah! Unh!

349
00:17:15,595 --> 00:17:16,679
What happened?

350
00:17:17,139 --> 00:17:19,140
He found out firebenders
killed Gyatso.

351
00:17:19,224 --> 00:17:21,642
No. It's his Avatar spirit.

352
00:17:21,935 --> 00:17:23,185
He must have triggered it.

353
00:17:23,270 --> 00:17:25,271
I'm gonna try and calm him down.

354
00:17:25,355 --> 00:17:26,731
Well, do it,

355
00:17:26,815 --> 00:17:28,649
before he blows us off the mountain!

356
00:17:43,749 --> 00:17:47,960
Remember your firebending basics,
Prince Zuko.

357
00:17:48,170 --> 00:17:49,795
They are your greatest weapons.

358
00:17:50,005 --> 00:17:51,255
I refuse to let him win.

359
00:17:53,216 --> 00:17:55,551
This will be over quickly.

360
00:18:34,925 --> 00:18:36,133
Basics, Zuko.

361
00:18:36,426 --> 00:18:37,635
Break his root.

362
00:18:38,387 --> 00:18:46,185
Unh!

363
00:18:55,904 --> 00:18:57,363
Aah!

364
00:19:15,882 --> 00:19:16,882
Unh!

365
00:19:24,641 --> 00:19:25,641
Do it!

366
00:19:30,147 --> 00:19:31,230
That's it?

367
00:19:31,857 --> 00:19:33,524
Your father raised a coward.

368
00:19:33,608 --> 00:19:36,026
Next time you get in my way,
I promise,

369
00:19:36,111 --> 00:19:37,820
I won't hold back.

370
00:19:48,373 --> 00:19:49,707
Unh!

371
00:19:50,834 --> 00:19:52,293
No, Prince Zuko.

372
00:19:52,377 --> 00:19:55,045
Do not taint your victory.

373
00:19:55,422 --> 00:19:57,798
So this is how
the great Commander Zhao

374
00:19:57,883 --> 00:19:59,133
acts in defeat?

375
00:20:00,135 --> 00:20:01,260
Disgraceful.

376
00:20:01,970 --> 00:20:03,429
Even in exile,

377
00:20:03,513 --> 00:20:07,099
my nephew is more honorable than you.

378
00:20:07,601 --> 00:20:09,685
Thanks again for the tea.

379
00:20:09,769 --> 00:20:11,437
It was delicious.

380
00:20:16,735 --> 00:20:18,194
Did you really mean that, uncle?

381
00:20:18,278 --> 00:20:19,778
Of course.

382
00:20:19,863 --> 00:20:22,531
I told you ginseng tea is my favorite.

383
00:20:27,454 --> 00:20:30,289
Aang, I know you're upset,

384
00:20:30,373 --> 00:20:31,916
and I know how hard it is

385
00:20:32,000 --> 00:20:33,834
to lose the people you love.

386
00:20:34,461 --> 00:20:37,505
I went through the same thing
when I lost my mom.

387
00:20:38,215 --> 00:20:40,424
Monk Gyatso and the other airbenders

388
00:20:40,509 --> 00:20:42,218
may be gone,

389
00:20:42,761 --> 00:20:45,095
but you still have a family.

390
00:20:45,180 --> 00:20:47,806
Sokka and I, we're your family now.

391
00:20:57,776 --> 00:20:58,776
Katara and I

392
00:20:58,860 --> 00:21:00,319
aren't gonna let anything
happen to you.

393
00:21:00,403 --> 00:21:01,529
Promise.

394
00:21:06,576 --> 00:21:07,701
I'm sorry.

395
00:21:07,786 --> 00:21:08,911
It's ok.

396
00:21:08,995 --> 00:21:10,287
It wasn't your fault.

397
00:21:10,372 --> 00:21:11,664
But you were right.

398
00:21:11,748 --> 00:21:13,457
And if firebenders found this temple,

399
00:21:13,792 --> 00:21:15,584
That means
they found the other ones, too.

400
00:21:16,378 --> 00:21:18,087
I really am the last airbender.

401
00:21:26,638 --> 00:21:27,930
Everything's packed.

402
00:21:28,014 --> 00:21:29,348
You ready to go?

403
00:21:29,432 --> 00:21:30,933
How is Roku supposed to help me

404
00:21:31,017 --> 00:21:32,309
if I can't talk to him?

405
00:21:32,394 --> 00:21:34,019
Maybe you'll find a way.

406
00:21:34,980 --> 00:21:36,397
♪♪♪♪

407
00:21:44,864 --> 00:21:46,532
Looks like you made
a new friend, Sokka.

408
00:21:47,867 --> 00:21:49,785
Can't talk. Must eat.

409
00:21:50,495 --> 00:21:51,870
Hey, little guy.

410
00:21:55,000 --> 00:21:57,376
You, me, and Appa--

411
00:21:57,586 --> 00:21:59,503
We're all that's left of this place.

412
00:21:59,588 --> 00:22:01,380
We have to stick together.

413
00:22:01,464 --> 00:22:03,257
Katara, Sokka,

414
00:22:03,800 --> 00:22:06,552
say hello to the newest
member of our family.

415
00:22:06,636 --> 00:22:07,761
What are you gonna name him?

416
00:22:10,557 --> 00:22:12,099
Momo.
